{
  "_comment": "Real prod catalog, 2026-11-20. Upload as s3://<release-bucket>/agent/services.json (scripts/package-agent.sh). name = prod deploy service_name (PM2 app name; the HA VM runs the same apps with a -ha suffix). Ports, instances, scripts and max_memory (500M = neonbee-deploy-prod.yml pm2_max_memory default) come from each repo's prod caller of neonbee-deploy-prod.yml and pm2/ss on the prod HA VM 84.247.131.148; every health_path answered 200 on that VM. type=nginx + static=true = a static bundle (Vite MFE remote / shell / SSO / portal) served by nginx from /opt/neonbee/services/<name>/current; prod_nginx_root is the current VM doc root, for writing the nb-nginx-sites site files. critical=true: Core, every backend routed by the api.neonbee.app gateway, storefront-api, storefront-web, shell and SSO (nb-health ignores type=nginx entries; only nginx itself is checked). Next.js apps (storefront-web-prod, partner-portal-prod) run `npm start -p <port>` on the VM today; on AWS their bundle must be Next standalone output (server.js). EXCLUDED by owner decision 2026-11-20: so360-command, so360-command-be, the marketing website (neonbee.ai), Internal Tools apps (tools-prod, shell-fe-tools) and so360-mobility* - never list them here.",
